# Lovato DMG300.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Lovato DMG300 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: lovato-dmg-modbus-i317.pdf (Doc. I317IGB02_22, 07/02/2022)
# | - 3-phase 4-wire power analyzer with datalogger, RS485 Modbus RTU.
# | - Holding registers (FC03); FC04 also accepted.
# | - UINT32/INT32 little-endian (LSW first), word_order = "le".
# | - Protocol address = table hex address − 1 (document states this explicitly).
# | - Adds equivalent (total) measures, voltage/current asymmetry, neutral current,
# | and 0.001 Hz frequency resolution vs. the DMG110/210.
# | - Energy at high address 0x1A20 (protocol 6687).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, configurable baud, 8N1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Lovato Electric
@model=DMG300
@vendor_website=lovatoelectric.com
@description=3-phase 4-wire power analyzer — per-phase V/I/P/Q/S/PF, totals, neutral current, asymmetry, energy, holding registers (UINT32/INT32 LSW-first).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/lovato-dmg300.toml; Source: lovato-dmg-modbus-i317.pdf (Doc. I317IGB02_22, 07/02/2022). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

